fly "Kargath, Badlands" npc 13177
map Badlands
turnin 3822
accept 4061
turnin 3906
tip Thunderheart patrols around Kargath. Leave his next task, Disharmony of Fire: Lord Incendius is deep inside Blackrock Depths.
accept 3981
tip Galamav the Marksman, near Thunderheart, sends you to Commander Gor'shak, a prisoner inside Blackrock Depths: optional, for a group, after the reavers.
fly "Flame Crest, Burning Steppes" npc 2861

# The reavers and the Ruins of Thaurissan ---------------------------------------------------------------

map Burning Steppes
do 4061 mobs 7039 7032 228725
tip War Reavers walk the slopes just south of Flame Crest; the Greater Obsidian Elementals and Firesworn drop shards too.
do 4296 icon use "Transcribe the Tablet of the Seven"
tip The tablet stands in the Ruins of Thaurissan, west of the reavers.
turnin 4296

# Blackrock Depths (optional, a dungeon) -----------------------------------------------------------

turnin 3981 at 34.8,85.3 in Searing_Gorge
tip Blackrock Depths is a dungeon for five players of about level 52-60, its portal on the lowest level of Blackrock Mountain. Commander Gor'shak is locked in a cell of the Detention Block, past High Interrogator Gerstahn: a rogue can pick the lock, or Gerstahn drops the key. Leave his next task, What Is Going On?, an escort deeper in. Not going? Right-click this step.

# Kargath, Grom'gol and Orgrimmar --------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Kargath, Badlands" npc 13177
map Badlands
turnin 4061
fly "Grom'gol, Stranglethorn" npc 2861
map Stranglethorn Vale
note "Take the zeppelin from the Grom'gol tower to Orgrimmar" at 31.5,29.5
map Orgrimmar
bind 6929
ah 91610.1 npc 8673
tip Kurll in Azshara wants 10 Winter Squid for his fishing quest, which he offers only to those who know Fishing (Apprentice is enough). Buying the squid here saves the fishing; without Fishing, skip this.
accept 4494
tip Zilzibin is in the Drag. This one is handed in at Gadgetzan in a later guide.
accept 91735
tip Jes'rimon hides upstairs in one of the tall buildings of the Drag.
accept 3504
accept 8151
tip Hunters only: Ormak Grimshot, the hunter trainer in the Valley of Honor, sends you to Ogtinc in Azshara.
accept 8250
tip Mages only: Uthel'nay, in the Darkbriar Lodge of the Valley of Spirits, sends you to Sanath Lim-yo, at the foot of Archmage Xylem's tower in Azshara.
accept 8254
tip Priests only: Ur'kyo, with the priest trainers in the Valley of Spirits, sends you to Ogtinc in Azshara.
ah 8256.1 npc 8673
tip Priests only: Ogtinc's third task wants an Ichor of Undeath, which drops from the undead of the Plaguelands and Winterspring, none on this route. Buy one here if it's cheap; without it, skip The Ichor of Undeath when Ogtinc offers it.
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
fly "Splintertree Post, Ashenvale" npc 3310
tip Ride east from Splintertree Post along the road into Azshara. With the Valormok flight path, fly there instead and take Loh'atu's quests at the end.

# Into Azshara: Loh'atu, Shadowsong Shrine and the Haldarr ------------------------------------------------

map Azshara
accept 5535 5536
tip Loh'atu camps by the road at Talrendis Point, just inside Azshara.
do 5535
tip The Highborne spirits haunt Shadowsong Shrine, north of Loh'atu.
do 5536
tip The Haldarr satyrs camp on the hill south of Valormok. Hand both in at the end, on the way out.

