# The Ruins of Eldarath and the shore --------------------------------------------------------------------

do 3517
tip The four tablets lie in the ruins; each kind has several spots, so click the first of each you see.
do 91568
tip Use the Treasure Trowel 3000 on the sand mounds along the shore east of the ruins. Sometimes a Makrinni Burrower comes out instead: kill it, it carries fragments too.
do 91610 at 46.0,52.0 icon use "Fish up 10 Winter Squid along the shore"
tip Kurll offers this only if you know Fishing; the guide skips it otherwise. Squid bought at the auction house count too.
accept 86746 86752
tip Ekkal stands in the north of the ruins. Players report that Report to Rageroar and the other Ursolan furbolg quests want Neutral standing with Timbermaw Hold, which starts at Hostile. If Ekkal doesn't offer Report to Rageroar, right-click to skip it and see the note at Ursolan.

# Valormok ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 3517 91568 91610
accept 3561 3541 3518
tip Jes'rimon and Magatha are handed in by later guides, in Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff.

# Archmage Xylem and Ursolan ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 8250
