note "Ursolan: if Gatekeeper Rageroar, Furze and Elder Bramblesnap offer you nothing, your Timbermaw standing is too low for them. Skip their quests: right-click the first step of each (Encroaching Corruption, An Unlikely Source and so on), and that quest's other steps go with it. The Legashi Threat and Blue Gold don't need them" npc 236573
