do 91569
tip The Blood Elf Arcanists camp along the cliffs east of Korsa. They hit like elites with Arcane Bolt and a near-instant Arcane Explosion: interrupt them. The wand is rare and drops for only one of you at a time (players report anything from a dozen kills to over a hundred): give it a few kills, then skip Blue Gold if it won't come.
do 8251 at 56.5,28.0
